WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

01:36.194 --> 01:38.664
Mai. Relax, all right?

01:38.824 --> 01:44.424
You're a little TOO relaxed! I mean,
we'll be going to school with a princess!

01:44.634 --> 01:49.334
All you have her for is the commute, right?
I have her for the same class!

01:49.404 --> 01:51.544
That's why you're being too relaxed about this!

01:51.544 --> 01:55.414
I swear... Last night, you were as freaked out
as the rest of us!

01:55.414 --> 01:58.744
Yeah. I freaked out once,
and then I got used to it.

01:58.744 --> 02:01.214
I can't tell whether you're
being relaxed or just dense.

02:02.514 --> 02:04.954
Who does that resemble, I wonder?

02:04.954 --> 02:07.654
Anyway, take care of
Princess Feena for me, all right?

02:07.894 --> 02:10.824
I'll do everything for her I possibly can.

02:11.664 --> 02:13.184
My apologies for keeping you waiting.

02:20.574 --> 02:21.904
How do I look?

02:22.034 --> 02:23.234
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!

02:23.234 --> 02:25.444
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!
The Princess is an A-Student!

02:25.444 --> 02:28.004
- Episode 2-
The Princess is an A-Student!

02:31.284 --> 02:34.014
Yeah. You look cute, Feena.

02:36.884 --> 02:39.874
Huh? Did I say something strange?

02:40.124 --> 02:41.694
Brother, I swear...

02:41.694 --> 02:44.384
Oh! "Cute" sounds too childish, huh?

02:45.264 --> 02:48.664
It's a change from your other dress,
but you look pretty, Feena.

02:48.664 --> 02:50.724
Th-thank you.

02:50.934 --> 02:52.164
Oh my, oh my!

02:52.164 --> 02:56.534
But it really does look very good on you,
Princess Feena.

02:56.534 --> 03:01.374
I thought everyone promised me
at last night's welcoming party...

03:01.374 --> 03:03.534
Have you forgotten, Miss Mai?

03:03.684 --> 03:08.114
I mean, Feena... Ma'am.

03:09.284 --> 03:11.114
That's right, Mai.

03:11.184 --> 03:14.054
But isn't this a little short?

03:14.054 --> 03:16.494
Once you get used to it,
it won't bother you at all.

03:16.494 --> 03:17.924
I suppose so.

03:18.494 --> 03:21.434
Here is your bag, Madam Princess.

03:21.434 --> 03:23.094
Thank you, Mia.

03:23.294 --> 03:26.234
U-um, Madam Princess...

03:26.234 --> 03:27.174
No.

03:27.174 --> 03:31.304
But Princess, this is your first time
to commute to school...

03:31.304 --> 03:35.414
Won't you allow me to accompany you
just for the first day?

03:35.414 --> 03:41.144
You still have to straighten up your room
and unpack our belongings, yes?

03:41.354 --> 03:42.714
Yes, ma'am.

03:42.914 --> 03:47.324
You don't have to worry about Feena.
We'll be right there with her.

03:47.594 --> 03:49.454
O-okay.

03:50.424 --> 03:52.454
Sis, what about your work?

03:52.694 --> 03:55.994
Oh, yeah. I think I'll be home late tonight...

03:56.234 --> 03:58.734
So you all eat without me at Samon's.

03:58.734 --> 03:59.904
Got it.

03:59.904 --> 04:01.974
Okay, we'll be back!

04:01.974 --> 04:02.904
We shall return.

04:02.904 --> 04:04.164
Take care!

04:15.154 --> 04:16.944
Mia is quite the handful.

04:17.184 --> 04:19.484
Huh? You mean because of before?

04:19.624 --> 04:20.914
That and...

04:21.154 --> 04:23.524
Ah. That thing last night.

04:23.524 --> 04:24.614
Yes.

04:24.894 --> 04:27.924
This is the room that you'll both be sharing.

04:28.334 --> 04:32.134
Thank you, Sayaka. It's a very lovely room.

04:32.134 --> 04:33.204
We are honored.

04:33.204 --> 04:35.104
Um, Madam Princess?

04:35.774 --> 04:37.764
What is it, Mia?

04:38.144 --> 04:39.544
Well...

04:39.544 --> 04:43.784
Sharing the same room as you Princess,
while an honor, is...

04:43.784 --> 04:46.284
Why? It does not concern me.

04:46.284 --> 04:48.774
But it simply won't do!

04:49.214 --> 04:51.154
I'm telling you that I do not mind.

04:51.354 --> 04:53.154
But this is just!

04:55.194 --> 04:58.124
But we don't have any other rooms.
This is a problem.

04:58.424 --> 05:02.154
Dad's study isn't really suitable
for a living space...

05:02.264 --> 05:06.664
Do you understand, Mia?
Your selfishness is troubling them.

05:06.834 --> 05:08.594
B-but...

05:08.804 --> 05:11.794
Ah! What about the room in the attic?

05:12.044 --> 05:14.404
Oh, I forgot about that.

05:14.514 --> 05:17.914
But it's cramped and I'm sure it's filthy.

05:17.914 --> 05:22.254
I'd like to stay there! Please!
I don't mind if it's cramped!

05:22.254 --> 05:24.224
And I love to clean!

05:24.224 --> 05:26.414
It doesn't matter if it's dirty!

05:26.854 --> 05:28.624
I suppose it can't be helped...

05:28.624 --> 05:31.384
But in return, will you honor what you said?

05:32.124 --> 05:34.194
Yes! I'll clean!

05:34.194 --> 05:39.694
Not just the attic room, but the entire house!

05:40.604 --> 05:43.704
I can understand Mia's position...

05:43.704 --> 05:46.764
but is sharing a room with me that disagreeable?

05:47.214 --> 05:50.704
And yet she wanted to accompany me to school.

05:53.084 --> 05:55.274
There certainly are a lot of stores, aren't there?

05:55.814 --> 05:59.384
Last night I took a different street,
so I didn't notice these.

05:59.384 --> 06:03.224
The stores around here will be
opening in a little while.

06:03.354 --> 06:04.794
So it would seem.

06:12.204 --> 06:14.324
Did you come here by car last night?

06:14.704 --> 06:18.164
Mia and I walked from the embassy.

06:18.304 --> 06:22.904
Walking is the best way to get to know
one's surroundings.

06:27.614 --> 06:31.154
Are rivers that unusual on the Moon?

06:31.154 --> 06:35.394
Lunar rivers are manmade, and smaller.

06:35.394 --> 06:38.094
What's more, they're only in the royal capital.

06:38.094 --> 06:40.494
Oh, really?

06:40.994 --> 06:44.564
Yes. Water is extremely precious.

06:44.564 --> 06:48.764
Real rivers are so much different
from my understanding of them...

06:50.804 --> 06:52.504
Shall we get going?

06:52.504 --> 06:53.494
Yes.

06:54.774 --> 06:55.844
Good morning!

06:55.844 --> 06:57.444
You're early today, huh?

06:57.444 --> 07:00.914
Yeah. We had Feena with us, so we left earlier.

07:00.914 --> 07:04.944
That was probably a good idea.
Feena will attract people's attention.

07:05.154 --> 07:08.744
Huh. So you can call her "Feena" now, can you?

07:10.024 --> 07:13.424
I think I'd still be too embarrassed
to say it in front of her...

07:13.424 --> 07:17.604
Oh yeah? Well, good luck. After all,
she's in the same class as us now.

07:17.604 --> 07:20.464
Oh, she's in the same class as us...

07:21.874 --> 07:23.804
Nobody told me that!

07:24.574 --> 07:26.544
All right, take your seats.

07:28.544 --> 07:30.484
Uh, to get right to it,

07:30.484 --> 07:33.914
we'll be welcoming an exchange student
into our class today.

07:35.814 --> 07:38.114
Okay, here she is.

07:39.124 --> 07:43.354
I'm Feena Fam Earthlight.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

07:45.624 --> 07:50.834
Now, she herself has asked for no special
treatment, so don't go getting all rigid.

07:50.834 --> 07:53.734
It'll be fine so long as you don't
cause a diplomatic issue!

07:54.674 --> 07:56.434
SO not funny...

08:09.714 --> 08:11.614
I wonder what's going on.

08:11.784 --> 08:13.184
Hello!

08:13.184 --> 08:16.024
The name's Midori Toyama,
and I'm in the seat in front of you!

08:17.264 --> 08:18.624
Glad to meet ya!

08:20.094 --> 08:24.134
Hello, Miss Toyama. The pleasure is all mine.

08:24.134 --> 08:27.624
Nice one, Toyama! Okay, Natsuki's next!

08:27.974 --> 08:29.934
Huh? Me?!

08:29.934 --> 08:31.134
Go! Go!

08:31.704 --> 08:34.764
F-Feena, how do you like our Earth schools?

08:34.874 --> 08:37.114
I don't quite know yet.

08:37.114 --> 08:42.274
This is my first time to study alongside
my peers in a place of learning.

08:42.614 --> 08:46.354
Therefore, I ask that you please teach me
what you can, Natsuki.

08:46.354 --> 08:47.994
Sure, just leave it to me!

08:47.994 --> 08:51.194
Natsuki, you're on a first-name basis
with a princess?

08:51.194 --> 08:53.564
Yeah! She told us to call her that last night.

08:53.564 --> 08:55.834
Huh? You already met her last night?

08:55.834 --> 08:59.764
Because she's doing her homestay
at Tatsuya's house.

09:00.674 --> 09:02.034
Oh, jeez!

09:02.204 --> 09:06.664
You mean, Asagiri is living under
the same roof as a princess?!

09:09.314 --> 09:12.314
So, you ready to begin your
interrogation, Asagiri?

09:12.314 --> 09:15.284
Goodbye, my days of peace and quiet!

09:15.384 --> 09:17.584
Natsuki, what's happened to Tatsuya?

09:17.584 --> 09:21.154
Uh, nothing. He's probably okay.

09:21.154 --> 09:22.814
U-um...

09:22.994 --> 09:24.614
Princess Feena?

09:27.494 --> 09:30.034
Come on, tell us more about the Moon!

09:30.034 --> 09:31.704
Do you have handsome guys back home?

09:31.704 --> 09:33.104
Introduce me to one, too!

10:01.594 --> 10:05.234
That guy you just fought was
vice president of the Kendo Club.

10:05.234 --> 10:08.404
We royalty must be well versed in the blade arts,

10:08.404 --> 10:11.674
but I am still nowhere near the
same league as my instructor.

10:11.674 --> 10:14.404
Still, that was incredible, Princess Feena!

10:15.014 --> 10:18.914
I mean, Feena.

10:19.014 --> 10:22.484
Yeah... To be a princess,
skilled in sports and athletics...

10:22.484 --> 10:24.354
and to be beautiful on top of that...

10:25.354 --> 10:27.154
Natsuki, you're too kind.

10:29.594 --> 10:31.564
Well, after all, we just finished P.E.

10:31.564 --> 10:34.634
Even princesses get hungry, huh?

10:34.634 --> 10:35.564
Honestly!

10:41.704 --> 10:43.104
How'd it go?

10:43.504 --> 10:45.074
Almost completely sold out.

10:45.074 --> 10:47.204
The cafeteria is completely full,

10:47.204 --> 10:49.814
and if we tried waiting,
we'd burn through our lunch hour.

10:49.814 --> 10:53.714
Oh. Fourth period P.E. Is do-or-die time, huh?

10:54.254 --> 10:56.444
I'll go off campus and buy us something.

10:56.584 --> 10:59.224
Tatsuya, you don't have to go to all that trouble.

10:59.224 --> 11:01.194
We just finished P.E., right?

11:01.194 --> 11:03.884
If we don't eat something, we won't
make it through the afternoon.

11:04.294 --> 11:08.354
If we let the lunar princess die of hunger,
it'll become a diplomatic issue.

11:08.464 --> 11:09.554
Tatsuya!

11:10.734 --> 11:11.494
Okay!

11:11.634 --> 11:15.734
Seriously, I saw her!
Some super-cute maid-looking girl!

11:15.734 --> 11:19.074
For real?! What would a maid
be doing on campus?

11:19.074 --> 11:21.134
Beats me, but she was here!

11:21.274 --> 11:22.834
Could that be?

11:26.884 --> 11:30.614
Mia? What could you be doing here?

11:30.924 --> 11:32.784
W-well...

11:32.854 --> 11:34.494
Princess, you...

11:34.494 --> 11:35.924
What about me?!

11:35.924 --> 11:38.464
Uh, what do you say we just leave it at that?

11:38.464 --> 11:41.134
We've got our lunch problem
figured out now, so...

11:41.134 --> 11:43.324
Did you make this, Mia?

11:46.804 --> 11:49.294
It's SO delicious!

11:49.474 --> 11:51.444
I suppose it can't be helped...

11:51.704 --> 11:55.044
But Mia, you mustn't do this again.

11:55.044 --> 11:56.444
Yes, ma'am.

11:56.714 --> 12:01.744
Very well. Then let's eat together.
The truth is, I'm starving.

12:05.624 --> 12:06.814
Yes, ma'am!

12:07.724 --> 12:09.924
Sometimes it's nice to have a boxed lunch, huh?

12:09.924 --> 12:12.554
Maybe I should make one next time.

12:12.794 --> 12:14.884
You can cook as well, Natsuki?

12:15.134 --> 12:17.464
Having learned directly from
your master chef, yes?

12:17.664 --> 12:20.904
No, actually, not so much... Uh...

12:20.904 --> 12:23.894
I ate Natsuki's cooking once, long ago.

12:24.144 --> 12:27.374
All the food was completely burned,

12:27.374 --> 12:30.414
but being young and innocent,
I believed that's how it was meant to be served

12:30.414 --> 12:34.554
but the second I put it into my mouth...

12:34.554 --> 12:35.714
Crunch!

12:35.984 --> 12:37.744
"Crunch"?

12:37.984 --> 12:40.624
Everything was completely charred.

12:40.624 --> 12:44.294
Since then, Natsuki has become infamous
by the nickname "The Master Carbonizer".

12:44.294 --> 12:45.794
I'm not infamous! I'm not infamous!

12:45.794 --> 12:48.294
I swear! One day I'll make you eat those words!

12:48.294 --> 12:49.994
Idiot!

12:52.504 --> 12:56.374
Madam Princess, is there anything
troubling you so far regarding school?

12:56.374 --> 12:59.174
No, everyone has been very helpful.

12:59.744 --> 13:01.234
I'm relieved to hear that.

13:01.574 --> 13:09.644
Moreover, it's been fascinating to hear what
thoughts my peers have regarding the Moon.

13:10.184 --> 13:15.124
Is it true that the Moon's gravity is 1/6th that of
the Earth, so you can jump six times as high?

13:15.124 --> 13:18.464
Does water and silver cost
the same amount by weight?

13:18.464 --> 13:21.654
Don't peoples' muscles get weaker
and their height get taller?

13:21.794 --> 13:26.634
Water is valuable, but price-wise it's
probably worth 1/100th of silver at best.

13:26.634 --> 13:29.074
And the Moon's habitable sections
are installed with artificial gravity,

13:29.074 --> 13:30.944
so people can't jump six times as high

13:30.944 --> 13:34.544
and of course their muscles don't get weaker
and their bodies don't change.

13:34.544 --> 13:37.274
All of that's basic Lunar Studies!

13:37.274 --> 13:41.284
Sure, these give you a chance for conversation,
but people should think a little before they ask.

13:41.284 --> 13:43.154
Not bad, young'un.

13:43.154 --> 13:47.254
All right, why don't you try namin'
the second largest of the lunar maria?

13:47.254 --> 13:51.724
Mare Imbrium, of course. It's the closest mare
to the royal capital, and...

13:51.724 --> 13:52.564
Huh?

13:52.564 --> 13:55.234
Mr. Takano! What are you doing here?

13:55.234 --> 14:00.534
I'm makin' a documentary on Miss Feena here,
so what's wrong with me bein' at her school?

14:01.474 --> 14:04.004
Tatsuya, you certainly know
a lot about the Moon.

14:04.004 --> 14:09.034
I guess. I entered this school because
that's what I wanted to study.

14:10.144 --> 14:15.484
Ever since I was a kid, I've wanted
to know all about the Moon.

14:16.984 --> 14:22.894
I'm the same way. I've wanted to know
about the Earth since I was young.

14:25.464 --> 14:29.594
I like ya, Kid. Here, this is a present from me.

14:32.164 --> 14:33.434
Mr. Takano!

14:33.434 --> 14:35.004
Come out, staff!

14:35.004 --> 14:36.404
Yes, sir!

14:43.514 --> 14:44.774
Merge complete!

14:45.644 --> 14:47.214
Escape in three seconds!

14:47.214 --> 14:48.374
Yes, sir!

14:52.654 --> 14:54.494
What was that, I wonder...

14:54.494 --> 14:55.384
Beats me.

14:55.824 --> 15:02.064
He's done documentaries on my mother
and grandmother, and is quite talented...

15:02.064 --> 15:07.864
Your mother? Could that be Queen Sefiria,
who passed away 10 years ago?

15:08.034 --> 15:14.374
Yes. She did her utmost for Terran-Lunar
relations, and I remain humbled by her.

15:14.374 --> 15:18.314
If I could one day catch up to her,
perhaps even surpass her...

15:18.314 --> 15:19.684
At least, that is my hope.

15:19.684 --> 15:21.944
Catch up, huh?

15:25.484 --> 15:27.894
Is that why you're studying here on Earth?

15:27.894 --> 15:30.254
That's not the only reason...

15:30.494 --> 15:34.754
But yes. I'm sure it's the biggest one.

15:35.794 --> 15:40.094
I'll help any way I can. I'll show you
I can be an even bigger help.

15:40.334 --> 15:41.764
Tatsuya...

15:43.034 --> 15:44.434
Thank you.

15:45.944 --> 15:47.304
A detour?

15:47.304 --> 15:48.344
Yeah.

15:48.344 --> 15:51.084
I thought it would also be good study

15:51.084 --> 15:52.814
for you to experience the culture
of the average Earth person.

15:52.814 --> 15:54.554
Earth culture?

15:54.554 --> 16:00.124
For example, those different shops that weren't
open this morning will be open by now.

16:00.124 --> 16:01.254
Really?

16:01.254 --> 16:05.524
Also... let's see. What do you say
we go see the river?

16:05.624 --> 16:08.154
The river? Yes, by all means!

16:10.064 --> 16:12.224
Karen, what are you doing here?

16:12.664 --> 16:14.864
You are Tatsuya Asagiri, correct?

16:14.974 --> 16:17.024
Y-yes...

16:17.474 --> 16:20.344
My apologies for not introducing myself sooner.

16:20.344 --> 16:25.074
I am Karen Clavius, military attaché
to the Embassy of Sphere Kingdom.

16:25.884 --> 16:30.754
I have heard much of you from Sayaka...
I mean, Chief Secretary Hozumi.

16:31.284 --> 16:33.584
The Princess is in your debt.

16:34.124 --> 16:37.624
I-it's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Tatsuya Asagiri.

16:37.624 --> 16:42.524
Miss Feena, my apologies for the suddenness,
but might I ask that you accompany us?

16:42.934 --> 16:46.524
Were my official duties not
scheduled for tomorrow?

16:47.234 --> 16:50.694
Circumstances dictated
that we moved it forward a day.

16:51.144 --> 16:52.264
Understood.

16:53.274 --> 16:55.674
Tatsuya, unfortunately we can't...

16:56.374 --> 16:57.674
Yeah.

17:06.124 --> 17:08.584
Brother! You have to clean properly!

17:11.794 --> 17:14.554
Jin! That's coming out of your pay!

17:18.604 --> 17:19.634
Good morning!

17:19.634 --> 17:21.434
Good morning, Tatsuya.

17:21.674 --> 17:23.364
Good morning, Tatsuya.

17:23.734 --> 17:26.404
The two of you were out late last night, huh?

17:26.404 --> 17:30.004
Yeah, that's right. There were several
things to get worked out.

17:30.214 --> 17:32.974
Did we wake you by chance?

17:34.214 --> 17:36.544
I didn't even notice you guys get home.

17:36.954 --> 17:41.914
I'm glad. I felt bad thinking I had awakened you.

17:42.294 --> 17:45.954
About our plans for yesterday,
how about today after school?

17:46.994 --> 17:53.294
I'm sorry. I really want to go, but I have more
official duties to perform now.

17:53.564 --> 17:55.334
So you won't be going to school either?

17:55.334 --> 17:56.904
No.

17:56.904 --> 18:02.844
Tatsuya, part of Feena's homestay here
is her official functions.

18:02.844 --> 18:05.834
I think there will be more days like this.

18:06.114 --> 18:07.344
Oh.

18:29.634 --> 18:32.574
Sis, huh? Welcome back.

18:33.044 --> 18:34.334
I'm home.

18:35.614 --> 18:37.104
Did you think I'd be someone else?

18:39.644 --> 18:42.984
It looks like Miss Feena will be
late tonight as well.

18:43.514 --> 18:48.594
You'd be better off just going to bed.
I'll be going to sleep myself.

18:48.594 --> 18:49.494
But...

18:49.494 --> 18:52.164
I understand how you feel.

18:52.164 --> 18:56.464
But sometimes, that kind of
concern can be a burden.

18:56.964 --> 18:59.954
Especially to someone in Feena's position.

19:03.334 --> 19:06.894
Young'un, you waitin' for Miss Feena?

19:08.314 --> 19:12.484
Mr. Takano?! I was just looking at the Moon.

19:12.484 --> 19:14.674
Hm. Is that so?

19:14.754 --> 19:19.714
In any case, why are you here? Aren't you
sticking a little too closely to Feena?

19:20.724 --> 19:25.454
THIS is what I wanna film, not some side
of the Missus that just anyone can!

19:27.724 --> 19:30.694
Feena is a princess after all, huh?

19:31.034 --> 19:35.864
But I'd been thinking of her
just as if she were a normal girl...

19:36.104 --> 19:40.264
That's why I'd been thinking I could do
something to help her...

19:40.944 --> 19:42.604
Even though she's a princess.

19:42.744 --> 19:48.184
Sure enough, the girls of that royal family
are princesses from birth.

19:48.184 --> 19:53.554
And it can be real hard, on
themselves and on others. And...

19:53.554 --> 20:01.154
As a result, you find yourself wantin'
to do somethin' for 'em. As family.

20:02.734 --> 20:03.994
Family...

20:04.164 --> 20:09.334
Right now, you aren't thinkin' you wanna
try and help her as a princess...

20:09.334 --> 20:13.444
But as family? Well, that's a different story.

20:13.444 --> 20:16.774
And that's the point of a homestay, right?

20:17.474 --> 20:21.644
So, young'un, just what is it
you wanna do to help?

20:24.354 --> 20:25.444
I want to...

20:27.624 --> 20:30.114
I suppose everyone is asleep now...

20:38.364 --> 20:40.334
Welcome home, Feena.

20:40.334 --> 20:42.824
Tatsuya! Why are you?

20:42.974 --> 20:45.994
This was all I could think of.

20:46.374 --> 20:51.074
The only thing I could do for a girl working
her hardest, living with us as family...

20:51.074 --> 20:56.604
was greet her when she came back
and say "welcome home."

20:58.154 --> 21:00.554
I'm back, Tatsuya.

21:02.794 --> 21:06.884
We royalty cannot easily seek
dependence upon others.

21:07.064 --> 21:11.234
I'd guess not. Looking at you, that's plain to see.

21:11.234 --> 21:13.704
But what about if royalty is family?

21:13.904 --> 21:15.264
Tatsuya...

21:16.974 --> 21:21.464
I wonder if you'd take me tomorrow
on that detour we had planned.

21:21.944 --> 21:23.374
Of course.

21:23.374 --> 21:24.534
Thank you.

21:31.884 --> 21:36.344
I-I'm sorry! This is, uh, I...

21:42.534 --> 21:47.634
Long ago... when you met that man...
That's how she looks now.

21:47.634 --> 21:53.704
Your daughter has a nice smile...
doesn't she, Sefiria?

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
Platinum no mikazuki

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Ima funwari tatazunda

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
Sora miagete omou

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
Ano nagareboshi kitto tsuki no namida ne

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
Soshite anata wo omotta

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Doushite watashi namida ga deru no

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Eien wo tada inotteiru noni

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
Mirai wo shinji aruite itai

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
Tsuki ga nankai michite wa kakete mo, anata to

23:25.164 --> 23:26.864
Preview

23:26.864 --> 23:28.674
Preview
From beyond the jet-black skies,
the Destroyer of Darkness arrives:

23:28.674 --> 23:30.174
From beyond the jet-black skies,
the Destroyer of Darkness arrives:

23:30.174 --> 23:32.544
The Empress of Carbonate, the
Master Carbonizer, Natsuki Takamizawa...

23:32.544 --> 23:35.474
Here, will she finally BLOW HER TOP?!
For what is this?!

23:35.474 --> 23:36.674
Towering slightly above, Natsuki stands
holding her whippin' spoon!

23:36.674 --> 23:38.184
- Episode 3-
The Princess and
the Cooking Battle!
Towering slightly above, Natsuki stands
holding her whippin' spoon!

23:38.184 --> 23:40.144
- Episode 3-
The Princess and
